# LuxeHide Atelier — Environment Configuration

# 1. Supabase Database Configuration
# Create a free project at https://supabase.com and copy Project Settings > API credentials
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# 2. Google Sheets Webhook Sync
# Create a Google Sheet > Extensions > Apps Script, paste the script from /admin, and deploy as Web App
VITE_GOOGLE_SHEETS_WEBHOOK_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/your-script-id/exec

# 3. Resend Email Dispatch (Optional)
# Get a free API key at https://resend.com for live customer email delivery
VITE_RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_api_key_here

# 4. Admin Panel Protection Passphrase
# Protected passphrase to access the /admin executive dashboard
VITE_ADMIN_PASSWORD=luxe@admin2026

